# Frontend build-time config (Vite).
# Copy to .env for local builds. Secrets are NOT needed here — the backend
# validates Telegram initData server-side; the frontend only sends X-Init-Data.
#
# Public HTTPS base of the Open Deck backend. The backend serves GET / (the
# compiled index.html) AND the /api/* endpoints.
VITE_API_BASE=https://opendeck-tma.serveousercontent.com
